ottom 30%**: 2D sewing pattern pieces for the pig's head, snout, and body. Dashed lines indicating sewing stitches and stuffing marks. Horizontal Chinese text: \"打样裁剪与线迹图\". A vertical ruler on the left edge marked \"0-35cm\". Bottom right corner has 3 circular color swatches (White, Pink, Black) with Chinese text \"白色\", \"粉色\", \"黑色\". Clean SeeThrough layers, ample white space, breathing room, 8k resolution, highly detailed, UI/UX layout. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0 --style raw --stylize 150\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 画面设计逻辑说明（符合您的定制需求）：\n\n1. **顶部（成品视觉区）**：\n   * **主体替换**：严格按照您的要求，将原默认的兔子替换为“正面站立的丑猪拟人化胖墩头大男性”。\n   * **材质与色彩**：强调“超柔灯芯绒肌理”，服饰的藻井纹样被限定在您指定的【白色、粉色、黑色】三色体系中，既有传统神韵又符合现代粉黑潮玩审美。\n\n2. **中部（结构拆解区）**：\n   * **工艺拆解**：平铺展示猪猪的“可穿脱服饰”正反面，放大镜特写展示白/粉/黑三色纱线的交织细节，标注“魔术贴连接点”与“包边工艺”，体现工业级严谨度。\n\n3. **底部（技术生产区）**：\n   * **打样与尺寸**：左侧刻度尺精确标注为 `0-35cm`（对应您的站高需求）。\n   * **裁片与线迹**：展示大头、猪鼻、身体的 2D 裁片，并用虚线明确标出【缝合线迹】与【填充标注】。\n   * **色卡规范**：右下角严格排列三个圆形色块，并标注中文：白色、粉色、黑色。\n\n*(注：AI 生成文字时可能会呈现为类似中文黑体的“伪文字”符号，这在视觉排版上完全符合工业设计稿的指示线排版美感。)*"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.7067260742188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "", "2,0", 0.6, 1582599820, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 72, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_na